    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamusmoó yaamaá Midiani oo ta bay Yetro, inós a taatoó harér Mose, kángw muruudá' Mungú aa tlehhaahhiít dír Mose nee xoorór Israeli, nee adór kingira duúx baraá Misrír wa ale, ngiwa axaás, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inós nee dasiirós tidá' ta bay Sipora, harér Mose, tiri alkoné' ay amór Mose, asma Mose hareerós gana ki/ís amór dooín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tina alkoné' nee daaqaydá' tsár oo Mose, oo wák umuuwós a Gershomu (Gershomu gídaabárós a aníng ana hoót adór dahaaymo baraá yaamá dahi'iimár wa ale). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Garmoó tsár umuuwós a Elieseri, (Elieseri gídaabárós a Munguú baabuúeé' aníng ina alee/iís, ina tuú/ dír Farao wa ale). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yetro, taatawuú harér Mose, nee dasiirose nee haywaá hatose, Mose nguri baraá xaanxáy ayé', inós xaftós gaa tleéhh dír tloomár Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose kuna kángw báy adór taatoó hareerós nee hareerose nee daaqaywós tsaraawo nir amoorós kayá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose iri tláy as ngiwa al'ay. Tiwa doogiyé', iri tumbarara'aát dír geeraá taatoó hareerós, guri ma'aás. Saayú nguwa hhe'eesiyé' hayooharo, tari dáh baraá heéma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Mose kangwdá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa tlehhahhiít dír Farao nee múk Misri as xoorór Israeli ngiwa ba/amiimisi, guri alki/a/iít dír taatoó harerós. Slahh'ámuú taa slasláy baraá loohiro, nee adór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngira wangexwadiít, gari káh sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yetro kuri qwal/atís nee tlehhmi'iiká hho' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa tlehhahhiít dír múk Israeli, awa ngiwa ba/amís gawaá dabaá múk Misriro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yetro iri oó', «AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i xirfuuti as kuungá' nuwa wangexwaár baraá lawaali'iimár Farao wa ale, nee dír múk Misriro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daxta aga tsaáhh adór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kur úr dír munguaá hatlá' sleémeerowo, asma kuungá' nuna wangeexwaár baraá dabaá múk Misrír wa ale, kudá' naa baramaanumamiis.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yetro, taatoó harér Mose, ilahhooár da/a nee ilahhooár muruú ta tsu/i garí haniís dír Mungú. Aroni iri hardáh dinkwa nee bariisér Israeli as tawa al/ayin nee Yetro dír geeraá Mungú wa ale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Looaytleérós Mose iri dír tlahháy iwiít as kwasleemadaá muu i kon ngiwa tleehhi, naxés Mose kuna harweér nee muu iimír matlaatlér wa ale ay tsiindo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Taatoó harér Mose kaangwí Mose i tlehhiiti dír múk Israeli i ale nguwa ga/aa/áy, Mose guri yaahaás, guri báy, «Ahaá, muu mus muruuwí tlehhít? Slám baré ana kilók iwít, nee muu una harweér bihhe sleémeero matlaatlér wa oohang ay tsiindo.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose taatoó hareerós guri báy, «Mukwí nina dir'eéní hardáh as sla'aarír Mungú ngiwa yaahamiisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk taa afo dakumiis birna hardáh un haraaki/ís, aníng an har'ohiím tla/ángw hee nee inslaawmoowose, nee in intsaahhatimís kaahír Munguhe nee adoodá' i slai.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Taatoó harér Mose iri oó', «Adoosíng ta tlehhit i qoondaaká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Looeemaawo kuúng gadiyeésíng u slaaqatís dinkwa nee mukdá' ni amoorók kakáw sleeme. Asma gadiyeésíng ka iiloo' diroge, kuúng kilók a tu/ká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gím daxtá, hara'ayar'eé' iiárií qaaseek, Mungú masók a dinkwa nee kuúng. Kuúng gadiyeérók a an sihhít dír geeraá Mungú as daanduú mukwí, nee axweesanoó gawdén un amoorós i huwaahúp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee inooín in intsaahhatimís kaahír Munguhe, nee adoodá' i slai, nee in xu'utís adoodá' kiwa hariím hotaawo nee tlehhtuuwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala muruú hatlá' dír kwihe, muu na leelehheek baraá tla/angw'ín wa ale, masók a múk aleesleemuú koóm, múk Mungú ilaiwawaá/, múk inkihhimuú koóm, múk slukmár /ayaaká. Waawiti'iimárí haniseek, bahh'ale múk kumuú wák ngu geeraharahariye', bahh'ale múk tsiiru, kooko múk mibeeri kooán, kuqá' múk mibaangw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín qaa/oó muksíng kun tlaaq umuú daqto, axweesanaydá' gawdén ngun amoorók i waarahhamisiye', ala axweesanaydá' ninákw ngu kilooín tlaaqiye'. Adoorí bar aga tléhh, kuúng hiinsla u gú/, asma inooín kuúng u alee/iisiyá' baraá gadiyeésinge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorí bar aga tléhh, nee bar Mungú gaa slaá' sleeme, daqaní kuúng nee mukwí a alhotá', nee inooín nin watliyá' amór maray'ín qaa/ay'ín aa faák.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Mose axweesantá taatoó harerós gaa waa/akutiiká, ala adoodá' ngwa báy sleémeero gari tleéhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose múk aleesleemú koóm baraá tla/ángw xoorór Israeliro guri tsawaár giri geeraharuusér wa qaás, barakarka a geeraharuusér múk kumuú wák gu geeraharahaar, tooka geeraharuusér múk tsiiru gu geeraharahaar, tooka geeraharuusér múk mibeeraá kooán gu geeraharahaar, tiqá' a geeraharuusér múk mibaangw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín kwasleemadaá muu ngina tlaaqiyé' umuú daqto. Qaa/oó ninákw sleémeero nguna tlaaqiyé', ala qaa/oó aa gawduy inooín nguna huwiyé' amór Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.18.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
